  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 574c2f64be3863946a607cb4789a8c66, type: 3}
  m_Name: Quest_Floor1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  tasks:
  - descriptionText: "1. First you must go to the supply closet Find the exit to
      the entry room that is directly across from the building entrance Then, once
      exiting, walk forward until you reach the far door Open the door and enter
      the closet 2. Turn right 90 Degrress and pick up a folder from the pile 3.
      With folder selected interacted with the GREEN paint and make a green folder
      4. Now that you have a green folder, go to the quality control desk  To do
      so, exit the supply closet and take the first door on your right Go to the
      desk at the far end of the room and you\u2019ll be golden! "
    id: Tut_Paint
    completePrevious: 0
  - descriptionText: 'Great! Now you are to be assigned a task that has been the
      end of many a hire! First, exit the room the door you came in from Next, walk
      down the hallway you came here in. Turn left down the hallway that appears
      to your left and walk forward The yellow folder will be on the table that appears
      to your left  Pick up the yellow folder Deliver yellow folder to Quality control
      desk '
    id: 1_Yellow
    completePrevious: 1
  - descriptionText: 'Great Job on your first completion! Now, you shall be given
      another task we frequent with the newer faces (player receives report) First,
      exit the room the door you came in from Next, walk forward and diagonally until
      you pass a door.  Turn left down that hallway and walk forward Once entering
      the far room turn left and walk down the wall Go to the copier and copy the
      Report! Deliver copied reports to Quality control desk '
    id: 1_Report
    completePrevious: 1
  - descriptionText: "Oh my! It appears your predecessor was engaged in fraud on
      behalf of the company! Well, we can\u2019t let that come back to bite us, so
      you are going to have to dispose of that.  Return to the copying machine The
      shredder is next to it, to the right of it when facing the copying machine
      and the wall Use the Shredder and DESTROY the compromising document "
    id: 1_Fraud
    completePrevious: 1
